==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} ''[[#Old Norse|fimmtán]]'', from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|fimftehun|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''fimmtán''' {{indecl}}

# '''[[fifteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[fjórtán#Icelandic|fjórtán]] and before [[sextán#Icelandic|sextán]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[fimmtándi]] {{m}}, [[fimmtánda]] {{f|n}}.

